<br>=0A=
Character matters leadership descends from character.=0A=
<br>=0A=
I hold this as a rule of life: Too much of anything is bad.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Victory has a hundred fathers but defeat is an orphan.=0A=
<br>=0A=
All progress is based upon a universal innate desire on the part of every o=
rganism to live beyond its income.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Have an aim in life -- then don't forget to pull the trigger.=0A=
<br>=0A=
He is no lawyer who cannot take two sides.=0A=
<br>=0A=
A faith is something you die for, a doctrine is something you kill for. The=
re is all the difference in the world.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Nothing marks the character of a young man more than failure.=0A=
<br>=0A=
To be thoroughly conversant with a man's heart, is to take our final lesson=
 in the iron-clasped volume of despair.=0A=
<br>=0A=
All kinds are good except the kind that bores you.=0A=
<br>=0A=
Look through your customer's eyes.  Are you the solution provider or part o=
f the problem?=0A=
<br>=0A=
One of the darkest evils of our world is surely the unteachable wildness of=
 the Good.=0A=
<br>=0A=
I strive to be brief, and I become obscure.=0A=
</body>=0A=
</html>=0A=

